# gRPC clients

Gateway: `AddGrpcClientsFromConfiguration` plus generated `*ServiceClient`.

Register the clients the service uses. Extra `Grpc:Clients` keys and missing addresses do not fail startup; Common logs a warning.

Unary calls get a 10s deadline unless the caller set one. Channel retries `Unavailable` and `DeadlineExceeded` (3 attempts). Streaming is unchanged.

Do not call `AddGrpcClient` without the Common helper.

```csharp
services.AddGrpcClientsFromConfiguration(builder.Configuration, registry =>
{
    registry.AddGrpcClient<FileShelfGrpcClient>();
});
```
